                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7457508-c828-48c8-bb04-066af899287f",
                                "sense_id": "d240d891-634f-32f6-9852-ab068d4d9461",
                                "text": "У́лица, зали́тая со́лнечным све́том, пестре́ла я́ркими пя́тнами кумачо́вых руба́х и весёлым оска́лом бе́лых зубо́в, грызу́щих подсо́лнухи; игра́ли вразбро́д гармо́ники, стуча́ли чугу́нные пли́ты о костя́шки, и голоси́сто ора́л пету́х, вызыва́я на бой сосе́дского петуха́.",
                                "translation": "The sun-lit street was bright with red shirts and the brilliant glitter of white teeth shelling the sun-flower seeds. Harmonicas were heard here and there; iron boards struck piles of knuckle-bones, scattering them in all directions; a rooster was crowing bravely, challenging another rooster to combat.",
                                "english": "The sun-lit street was bright with red shirts and the brilliant glitter of white teeth shelling the sun-flower seeds. Harmonicas were heard here and there; iron boards struck piles of knuckle-bones, scattering them in all directions; a rooster was crowing bravely, challenging another rooster to combat."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
